# AI provider configuration has moved to a single repo-wide file.
#
# Per-skill `.env` is no longer the provider source. Configure your provider
# (API key, base URL, model, protocol) once in:
#
#     config/providers.yaml.example  →  copy to config/providers.yaml
#
# Both the desktop-app runs and the crontab-driven Python runs read that file.
# This `.env.example` is retained only for backward reference.
